		Heading 1:
			Text: Item content
		Paragraph: A `List item` is a block: it holds paragraphs, texts, images or tables, but not headings, and it starts with a text so that the marker has a first line to sit on. Its `Box` and `Typography` are those of the item, and the marker takes its typography.
			Style: intro
